DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Alice, Bob
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF Pay HAS payer IS AN Actor, amount IS A NUMBER

GIVEN who IS AN Actor
      amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN Action
`payment by` MEANS Pay who amount

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
rent MEANS
    PARTY  Alice
    MUST   (`payment by` Alice 1500)
    WITHIN 7
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH
